
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CyberSafe | Online Security</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0b1120;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        header {
            background: #111c33;
            padding: 25px 10%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #0284c7;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 10%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #17243b;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 220px;
            max-width: 320px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #111c33;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>CyberSafe.</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#security">Security Tips</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Stay Safe in the <span>Digital World</span></h2>
        <p>
            Technology connects us, but staying protected online
            is more important than ever. Learn how to recognise
            threats and protect your personal information.
        </p>
        <a href="#security" class="button">Explore Security Tips</a>
    </section>

    <section class="content" id="security">
        <h2>Protect Yourself Online</h2>
        <p>Three simple ways to improve your online security.</p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Phishing Awareness</h3>
                <p>
                    Be careful with unexpected emails and messages.
                    Check links and verify the sender before sharing
                    personal information.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Password Security</h3>
                <p>
                    Use long, unique passwords for your accounts.
                    Consider using a password manager and
                    enable two-factor authentication.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Protect Your Privacy</h3>
                <p>
                    Avoid sharing sensitive personal information
                    online. Review your privacy settings and only
                    use websites you trust.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>CyberSafe | Created as a personal learning project</p>
        <p>Building awareness. Creating a safer digital world.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
